; EpoCanva P3.6 / W3-B -- exports of the hosted TEST DLL variant.
;
; This is NOT the product DLL and not a registration mechanism. The two COM entry points are
; the same ones the product DLL exports, now including the W3-B registration entry points
; (present so the export contract is identical; the lifecycle test checks presence only and
; never calls them, so no registry key is written by this variant). The EpoCanvaTest* names
; are the private lifecycle seam: fixed C/POD parameters only, no callbacks, no internal
; object access, no STL.
EXPORTS
    DllCanUnloadNow                     PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject                   PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer                   PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer                 PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetEngineConfig         PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestClearEngineConfig       PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestGetDiagnostics          PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetStartGate            PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetStopGate             PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetCleanupGate          PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetForceCleanupFailure  PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestLeaseDoubleRelease      PRIVATE
